== Overview ==
The Airplane Toilet is a very fast medium health [[Enemies|enemy]] that appears on [[Hard Mode]] and [[Nightmare Mode]]. Due to its moderate health and high speed, this toilet can easily fly through your defenses. Just like all other enemies, it appears on [[Endless Mode]].

== Appearance ==
The Airplane Toilet carries a large jet engine and flies on an airplane.

