== Strategy ==
* Use units that can slow down the toilet to defeat it. For instance, [[Guardian Clockman]] and [[Green Laser Cameraman]]
* You don't need [[Medic Cameraman]] or [[Camera Repair Drone]] to deal with this unit because it doesn't stun.

== Trivia ==
* This unit is based off [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Warhead_Skibidi_Toilet Warhead Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
* The Airplane Toilet cannot stun any units, despite heavily damaging the [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]] and [[Upgraded Titan Speakerman]] in the series.

